# Density Compare
# Promethium (Pm) — real density 7.26 g/cm³. equal masses: Promethium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Promethium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.3mm color: #6aff6a at (-20mm, 5.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 57.9 g — the water cube is the reference
